  productsServicesSummaryEn:
    "China Composites Expo describes DeepSea as a developer and manufacturer of industrial X-ray inspection equipment and solutions, including industrial CT, digital radiography, portable equipment, 2D/3D imaging software and custom systems. The official industrial site identifies the Seamaster Pro compact CT system, portable X-ray generators and portable digital-imaging systems, plus the DeepVISION 2D, DeepPRECISION 3D and DeepNDT software platforms. Published sectors include aerospace, defense, casting, pressure vessels and pipelines, electronics, research and additive manufacturing. These are company-published claims; GetFRP does not infer a guaranteed material, defect size, penetration, scan speed, uncertainty or regulatory approval. An RFQ for CT or digital radiography of composite parts should define material and sandwich construction, maximum envelope and mass, inspection region, thickness and density range, target defects, minimum relevant defect, spatial and contrast resolution, cycle time, fixturing, data retention and acceptance rule. Require a reproducible feasibility study on an actual or representative part with raw data, reference samples, repeatability results and stated limitations; promotional images are not acceptance evidence. Fix source voltage and power, focal spot, detector and pixel pitch, magnification, stage travel and load, enclosure, shielding, interlocks, emergency stops, utilities and software scope. Radiation-equipment selection, shielding, installation, permits, operator qualifications, dose monitoring and procedures must be checked against the configured machine and destination rules; a product page is not regulatory approval. FAT should use agreed composite samples or defect references and record scan settings, resolution, detection, repeated scans, processing time, report export, safety interlocks and continuous operation. SAT should confirm local utilities, shielding, network, access, backup, training and cycle time. Control software version, reconstruction method, filters, thresholds, decision rules, raw-data retention, audit trail, exports, remote access and cybersecurity. When results support release or qualification, define the NDT method, written procedure, personnel qualification, calibration checks, references, uncertainty and report responsibility. Compare offers on one supply boundary covering source, detector, workstation, fixtures, cooling, power conditioning, transport, lifting, installation, training, samples, spares and consumables; also confirm warranty, service response, critical-component lead time, software renewal, replacement costs, export packing and Incoterm. The corporate site provides an English route, phone and email, but its English pages contain unfinished fields and the industrial subdomain's HTTPS certificate was expired at review time although HTTP remained available. Reconfirm the quoting and payee entity and current English documents through the corporate-domain email. No official certificate showing the complete legal entity, standard, number, scope, issuer and current validity was found, so none is recorded as verified; promotional high-tech-enterprise wording is not treated as certification.",
